  "description": "The package is designed to be able to use services, helpers, models, and other general-purpose components in .NET applications. \n        It includes tools for serializing and deserializing data, pagination management, and auxiliary classes for performing routine tasks. \n        This package simplifies development by allowing developers to focus on business logic rather than technical details. \n        In the future, it is planned to add additional general-purpose classes and interfaces to enhance functionality.",
